  "description": "This edition of the T.E.M.P.O. T-Type features the exclusive Crackled Black paint job. This is our beefiest T.E.M.P.O.\n• Suspension is managed by FOX with a Float X and a 36 Grip 2. The shock brings more consistency and optimised operation, where the stiffer fork will increase the steering precision and the increased front travel (150mm), and will therefore offer a boost of confidence to the rider. The playfulness that is synonymous with the T.E.M.P.O. is retained when pushing and accelerating.\n• SHIMANO Deore XT M8100 two-piston brakes with 203 / 180mm discs with Ice Tech Freeza aluminium pads.\n• DT SWISS XMC 1501 Spline One wheels offer an unmatched weight, performance, and comfort ratio.\n• Transmission is entrusted to SRAM with the XO Eagle T-Type electronic group. An indestructible derailleur plus ultra-precise shifting equals performance.",
